  "open": [
   "Only a 0.5x speed scale and time shifts of 0, +1 and +2 s were tried. Speed scales above 0.5x and negative time shifts were never tested. Screening them on the five scenes without confirmed failures could find the two missing cases.",
   "Whether the policy rear-ends a braking lead car at all is still open. Slowing the lead car made the replayed ego hit it before handoff. Runs that slow the lead car less (0.7\u20130.9x), or that hand control to the policy earlier, are needed to test the policy itself.",
